      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROCKY RACCOON (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 8 lengths at this track in a handy 23.42 beating Sarah Starfish. Goes well out of this box with a win and four minor placings. Looks the one to beat. SCOTCH ROCKET (7) was well fancied last time on the strength of a win two back but could only manage fourth (24.31) at this track. Worth another chance. BOULDER BEACH (6) latest effort finished 4th in a Grade 4/5 on October 4 over 407m at this track behind ROCKY RACCOON beaten 13 lengths (24.37). Suited here and expected to run well. WEBLEC WHISPER (2) placed here at this trip last start - cannot be ignored.",
